# AI movie pipeline: Synology DS423 NFS mounts for the DGX Spark.
# Appended to /etc/fstab by setup_spark.sh (idempotent — grep-guarded).
#
# Design notes for 1GbE:
# - NFSv4.1 with 128KB rsize/wsize (NAS caps server-side at 32KB anyway; the
#   client negotiates down safely).
# - x-systemd.automount + nofail: the Spark boots cleanly with the NAS off.
# - noatime: no read-triggered metadata writes across the wire.
# - These mounts are for projects/archive/sync only. Hot model weights live on
#   the Spark NVMe (~/ai/models) — never load models over the network.

192.168.68.131:/volume1/AI_Models         /mnt/synology/models    nfs4  nfsvers=4.1,rsize=131072,wsize=131072,noatime,nofail,x-systemd.automount,x-systemd.idle-timeout=600,_netdev  0  0
192.168.68.131:/volume1/Active_Projects   /mnt/synology/projects  nfs4  nfsvers=4.1,rsize=131072,wsize=131072,noatime,nofail,x-systemd.automount,x-systemd.idle-timeout=600,_netdev  0  0
192.168.68.131:/volume1/Portfolio_Archive /mnt/synology/archive   nfs4  nfsvers=4.1,rsize=131072,wsize=131072,noatime,nofail,x-systemd.automount,x-systemd.idle-timeout=600,_netdev  0  0
